{"type":"text","timestamp":1794370355019,"sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","part":{"id":"prt_1c8cebf29001g5fAUz2wEdxFpH","messageID":"msg_1c8cea833001fU0HqqHqJFpNvR","sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","type":"text","text":"<think>The pkill killed my own shell probably (pkill -f \"port=8010\" matched the bash command itself). Let me be careful. Let me restart the server differently.\n\nAlso note .venv isn't showing in ls — because ls doesn't show hidden. Fine.\n\nLet me start server with nohup and setsid, avoiding pkill patterns that match theshell.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794370354985,"end":1794370355013}}}
