{"type":"text","timestamp":1794370478643,"sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","part":{"id":"prt_1c8d0a204001dK6dv2oP0K6ZHV","messageID":"msg_1c8d09481001C07gQ1kdw5UuqK","sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","type":"text","text":"<think>The shell hangs because of the background job holding the shell. Let me be careful — use `setsid ... &` with output redirected; the issue is the shell waits for the pipe. Actually the command completed (curl output shown) but the shell tool waited. Let me just run the test now in a fresh command.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794370478596,"end":1794370478617}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794370479381,"sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c8d09cc67719bda130e9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8011/api timeout 60 python3 backend/api_check.py 2>&1 | tail -20"},"output":"  \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-11T04:14:39.270899Z\"\n}\nok   GET /notes?tag=work -> 200\nok   GET /notes?author=alice -> 200\nok   GET /notes?q=second -> 200\nok   GET /notes?page=1&page_size=1 -> 200\nok   GET /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 403\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 401\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 403\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 401\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 200\nok   GET /notes/2 -> 404\nok   GET /tags -> 200\n   tags: {'items': [{'count': 1, 'tag': 'keep'}, {'count': 1, 'tag': 'solo'}]}\nok   GET /health -> 200\nALL GOOD\n","metadata":{"output":"  \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-11T04:14:39.270899Z\"\n}\nok   GET /notes?tag=work -> 200\nok   GET /notes?author=alice -> 200\nok   GET /notes?q=second -> 200\nok   GET /notes?page=1&page_size=1 -> 200\nok   GET /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 403\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 401\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   PATCH /notes/1 -> 200\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 403\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 401\nok   DELETE /notes/2 -> 200\nok   GET /notes/2 -> 404\nok   GET /tags -> 200\n   tags: {'items': [{'count': 1, 'tag': 'keep'}, {'count': 1, 'tag': 'solo'}]}\nok   GET /health -> 200\nALL GOOD\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8011/api timeout 60 python3 backend/api_check.py 2>&1 | tail -20","time":{"start":1794370478605,"end":1794370479364}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8d0a208001VmLEaHsb673OTA","sessionID":"ses_e37366a2affe5Df7hppu0PfBho","messageID":"msg_1c8d09481001C07gQ1kdw5UuqK"}}
